 After\nbuilder.build();\n```\n\nThe Java agent no longer supports `otel.instrumentation.lettuce.experimental.command-encoding-events.enabled`. Neither the agent nor the standalone library emits `redis.encode.start` or `redis.encode.end` span events.\n\nFor Lettuce 5.1+, agent telemetry now uses `io.opentelemetry.lettuce-5.0` instead of `io.opentelemetry.lettuce-5.1`. Update any filters or dashboards that match the old instrumentation scope.","title":"Remove Lettuce 5.1 javaagent module"},"mode":"publish","pr":20533,"pr_author_id":198982749,"protocol":"git-candidate-v1","publication":{"auth_mode":"fine_grained_pat","authorized_actor_id":218610,"authorized_at":1791844512,"generation":4,"max_pipelines":5,"phase":"344bd3d9e4ab4b048bdb682fa7ebd0a6","profile":"git-candidate-v1","required_checks":["Analyze (actions)","Analyze Java (none)","Analyze Kotlin (manual)","CodeQL","EasyCLA","build / build-servlet-images","build / common / build","build / common / check-gh-aw-lockfiles","build / common / examples","build / common / fossa-configuration-check","build / common / gradle-plugins","build / common / license-check","build / common / repo-checks","build / common / smoke-test (ubuntu-latest, jetty)","build / common / smoke-test (ubuntu-latest, liberty)","build / common / smoke-test (ubuntu-latest, other)","build / common / smoke-test (ubuntu-latest, payara)","build / common / smoke-test (ubuntu-latest, spring-aot)","build / common / smoke-test (ubuntu-latest, tomcat)","build / common / smoke-test (ubuntu-latest, tomee)","build / common / smoke-test (ubuntu-latest, websphere)","build / common / smoke-test (ubuntu-latest, wildfly)","build / common / spotless","build / common / test0 (11, hotspot)","build / common / test0 (17, hotspot)","build / common / test0 (21, hotspot)","build / common / test0 (25, hotspot)","build / common / test0 (25-deny-unsafe, hotspot)","build / common / test0 (27, hotspot)","build / common / test0 (8, hotspot)","build / common / test1 (11, hotspot)"